# This repository is public. Anything listed here is deliberately kept local.

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# Working notes and planning docs — local only, not part of the product.
CLAUDE.md
DESIGN.md

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea

# Cloud-sync conflict copies. This repo lives under ~/Desktop, which iCloud
# syncs, and it periodically leaves byte-identical duplicates named
# "Dashboard 2.tsx" beside the real file. They get compiled and linted like any
# other source file, so keep them out of the tree.
* [0-9].*
*\ copy.*
*\ copy\ [0-9].*
